        "cooked": "<p>A friend just showed this to me, and I thought I’d share.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\">  <a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/AZURJyHXw4S2\">Here’s the real-world Spirit Island</a>!  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=9\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"></p>\n<p>It’s <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=spirit+island+high+res&amp;tbm=isch&amp;source=lnt&amp;tbs=isz:lt,islt:4mp&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=0ahUKEwinvcya2bzZAhXF5IMKHehAAtIQpwUIHg&amp;biw=1920&amp;bih=949&amp;dpr=1\">a little smaller</a> than the island in the game’s 'verse, though.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\">  (I think Slumbering Serpeant is curled up under a rock…)</p>",
